# The HTTP client variation point attaches to the base plateau: it adds the
# fixed client code (Client.Abstractions, Client.Http), the todo API's adapter
# and its mock, the service over it, and the command that uses it, and changes
# only these base files: the composition root and its project, the project of
# the module whose service uses the adapter, the solution, and the build and
# readme files.
base library/architecture/dotnet/base-plateau-in-dotnet.skill/examples
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/App/App.Host/App.Host.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Todo.Application.csproj
change Todo.slnx
change Makefile
change README.md
# The todo API's adapter is written per API: the HTTP and the gRPC client
# examples each show their own. The service over it catches only the outcomes
# of Client.Abstractions, the same for both.
sample src/Infrastructure/Client/TodoApi/*
